{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "mcp-excalidraw-server",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "l_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The lifecycle at one level",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_sub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 70,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The three are not a menu you pick from. They happen in this order, and the trade is the last handoff.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_r1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 124,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 96,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_t1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "1   A move arrives, fast",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d1a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Aggressive orders drive price through a zone quicker than anyone can transact in it.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d1b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 192,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "It leaves a thin node behind — the zone of initiation.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "volume profile",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_r2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 96,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_t2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 256,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "2   EXHAUSTION",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d2a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 286,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The far end of that move: a taper, a blowoff, a fat bubble on the delta map. The people who",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d2b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 308,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "drove it are now positioned wrong, and to get out they must trade the other way.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 286,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "volume profile",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w2b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 308,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "delta map",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_r3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 356,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 96,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_t3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 372,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "3   ABSORPTION",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d3a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 402,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The aggressors keep coming and get eaten. Resting orders refill at the same price. Volume",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d3b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 424,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "prints, price does not move.   \"Absorption takes time.\"   Do not enter here.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 402,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "delta profile",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w3b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 424,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "DOM  +  tape",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_r4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 472,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 96,
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_t4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 488,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "4   Your opponent steps away",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d4a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 518,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The wall stops coming back. Size dwindles, then pulls.   \"It's all blue right now. The blue",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 540,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "means it's pulled off.\"   This is the moment the trade becomes available.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 518,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "DOM only",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_r5",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 588,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 96,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_t5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 604,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "5   INITIATIVE, the other way",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.269Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d5a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 634,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Sweeps that progress, and resting orders climbing the ladder behind them. The side that",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_d5b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 656,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "was absorbing is now advancing.   This is the entry, and the confirmation after it.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_w5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 634,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "tape  +  DOM",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_foot",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 712,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 78,
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_ft1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 728,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"that absorption is now flipped to the other participant and we're passing the ball back and forth\"   —  04-30 @40:11",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "l_ft2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 756,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "You enter on the handoff between 4 and 5 — never inside 3.   \"I don't wish to be sitting in absorption indefinitely.\"",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:34:48.270Z",
      "version": 1
    }
  ],
